Date: 2026-11-26
Agent: agy (Gemini)
Branch: dev

SUMMARY

  Implemented R1 finding 11 (surviving a GPU reset) for Tamlinux 0.7.0
  Milestone 9 / plans/P4-dogfood-tamlinux-0.7.md:
  - Added `renderer_lost` listener, `renderer_lost_idle` event source, and
    `renderer_recoveries` counter to `struct tp_server` in
    `include/tam-pane/server.h`.
  - Added `tp_capture_reset_sources()` in `include/tam-pane/capture.h` and
    `src/capture.c` to detach cached toplevel capture sources created with
    the old renderer/allocator.
  - Wired `s->renderer->events.lost` in `src/server.c`: `on_renderer_lost`
    detaches itself and schedules `on_renderer_lost_idle` (so
    `wlr_renderer_destroy` runs outside `wl_signal_emit_mutable`, avoiding
    wlroots' `wl_list_empty(&r->events.lost.listener_list)` assertion).
    `on_renderer_lost_idle` recreates `wlr_renderer` and `wlr_allocator`,
    re-arms `renderer_lost`, updates `wlr_compositor_set_renderer`, resets
    cached capture sources, re-initializes every active output via
    `wlr_output_init_render` + `wlr_output_schedule_frame`, destroys the old
    allocator and renderer, and increments `renderer_recoveries`.
  - Added a back-to-back double-reset headless test in
    `tests/test_input_headless.c`, bumped `VERSION` to `0.2.10`, updated
    `plans/P4-dogfood-tamlinux-0.7.md`, and installed to
    `~/.local/bin/tam-pane`.

